d stone imbued powers  and then it quotes kevin feige saying if  you look at the infinity saga  i don't think any single person has gone  through more pain and trauma than wanda  maximoff  and no character seems to be as powerful  as wanda maximoff  sidenote this is kevin feige seemingly  confirming that wanda is indeed the  strongest character in the mcu but he  continues to say  and no character has a power set that is  as ill-defined and unexplored as wanda  maximoff  so it seemed exploring that would be  worthwhile  post-endgame who else is aware of that  power  where did it come from did the mine  stone unlock it  so those three questions at the end are  extremely important and pretty revealing  and we'll start with the first question  who else is aware  of that power now in the comics wanda is  indeed a mutant an omega  level mutant but however her chaos  magical powers were given to her by the  demon chathan  now the demon chathan could show up in  the wanda vision series and he also  could show up in doctor strange in the  multiverse of madness  but remember this is the mcu they don't  exactly copy the comic books page for  page  in fact they do like to change things up  and there's been a lot of rumors going  around that the demon that is actually  going to show up  is a fisto in fact it's been said that  evan peters is confirmed to have a role  in the one division series and a lot of  people think that that role  is indeed the demon mephisto now as some  of you may know he has  a very big connection to wanda in the  comics when wanda magically gets  pregnant  and has her two twin boys she would go  on to find out that they were actually  the shards of the spirit of the demon  mephisto  and she ends up taking them back and  loses her kids and this sends her down a  very dark path that would ultimately  lead to the house of  m storyline now could mephisto actually  be responsible for giving her her powers  that's unclear at this point and it  would kind of be an unnecessary retcon  however we go back to kevin feige's  question who else is aware of that power  that the scarlet witch has  it definitely seems like it is going to  be him especially when you consider that  doctor strange is confirmed to appear in  the one division series  dealing with demons is kind of what  doctor strange does  so this makes perfect sense that he's  going to have to come into the one  division series to help  wanda deal with mephisto and also  control her powers  now the last two questions go hand in  hand but are very important  where did it come from speaking of her  powers and did the mind stone  unlock it now in the movies it was said  that the mind stone  did give them their powers it didn't say  they unlocked any powers it said that it  gave them their powers  but now all of a sudden the president of  marvel studios is asking the rhetorical  question  did the mind stone unlock her powers and  he's also saying  where did they come from so he is now  getting us to question  something that marvel studios has  actually already stated  so this means this is kevin feige saying  wanda didn't actually get her powers  from the mind stone they actually unlock  something  and of course for us fans waiting for  the mutants and the x-men to come into  the mcu we can only think of one thing  the x-gene the mutant gene typically the  x-gene lies dormant inside of mutants  until awoken and then they start to  exhibit their mutant powers  so essentially the question that kevin  feige is asking and getting us to think  about  is that did she have the x gene and did  the mind stone unlock  and awaken her mutant x gene this is  seemingly how they're going to introduce  the mutants and the x-men into the mcu  stating that they actually had the gene  the whole entire time  but perhaps the snap awoken some of the  x genes inside some people so it looks  like  wanda is in fact going to be a mutant in  the one division series  so how exactly is the true scarlet witch  going to come into play  well there are a couple of characters  that are seemingly going to help wanda  develop her powers  even further one is agatha harkness now  a lot of people seem to think that she's  going to be a villain of the series  that perhaps it's her that is creating  all of these different realities for  wanda and possibly even trapping her  inside and certainly in the comics she  has warped with wanda's reality a little  bit but it was for her own good  you see agatha harkness for the most  part in the comics is a good person who  definitely cares about wanda  in the comics she trains her and she  teaches her about her powers  she's also trusted by the fantastic four  to take care of franklin richards the  son of sue storm  and reed richards so although there is  definitely room for agatha harkness to  be a villain in the one division series  it's more likely that she's going to be  a good person  a good witch who is going to help wanda  become a good witch as well a very  powerful witch  the scarlet witch and then of course  doctor strange is confirmed to be in the  wanda vision series  now of course he is the master of the  mystic arts he knows a lot of different  spells and he knows how to help  wanda control her powers and grow them  and this is where seemingly the darkhold  is going to come in  now the darkhold's origin goes back to  the demon i mentioned that gave wander  her powers in the comics the demon  chathan  chauthon was a demonic elder god who was  earth's first practitioner of blackmagic  he wrote the book he put all of his  collected knowledge about magic  into this book and the book is so  powerful that even the wizard merlin  and saint brendan could not control it  or destroy it  well wanda learning this type of magic  will definitely give her a huge power  boost  in the mcu wanda has kind of only messed  around with her own chaos magic  abilities she hasn't exactly used any  spells  but now she's going to have agatha  harkness and doctor strange who are  going to be there to help her  learn different types of spells and  different ways to control her powers  now this alone would give wanda a very  big power boost and according to kevin  feige she's already the most powerful  character in the mcu  this could finally earn her her title of  the scarlet witch which she has in the  comics  alone but we know that there's going to  be more there's going to be something  that sends wanda  over the edge to completely bring out  the scarlet witch in her and  unfortunately it's probably going to be  the loss of her children  now we've seen her kids wicken and speed  in the trailer but as i mentioned in the  comics mephisto wants them back and he  takes them back  and what happens after that is a very  long and awesome story but to put it  simply  wanda slowly starts to go insane until  eventually she creates the house of m  reality where mutants rule the world and  magneto  and the scarlet witch along with  quicksilver and her two children  rule the world now this is true scarlet  witch power and although i don't think  she's going to be ruling the world in  the one division series  i do think that she's going to want and  try to get her kids back which is where  i think doctor strange is going to come  in and try and help  and from here where she's devastated at  the loss for kids and absolutely over  the top angry  i think that's when we'll see her  explode on the demon mephisto or another  villain  to fight and get her kids back and  that's when i think we're going to get  the true  scarlet witch that we've been waiting  for the omega level mutant with  chaos reality warping magic the scarlet  witch there is a ton of stuff to be  excited for and a lot of stuff we're  anticipating for the one division series  but let me know in the comments down  below how excited you are to finally see  the true scarlet witch  on screen be sure to let me know in the  comments down below don't forget to like  the video and subscribe  stay up to date on all the latest mcu  news for live updates you can follow me  on instagram and twitter and as always  thank you all so much for watching  woof  you

